Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.81,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,120)\fscx145\fscy145\bord3.5}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.19,0:00:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the endless dream guides\Nyour restless spirit,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.81,0:00:20.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,59)\fscx120\fscy120\bord3.3}Timing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.81,0:00:20.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,120)\fscx145\fscy145\bord3.5}Gab
