Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think back to the time\Nwhen my search first began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.77,0:00:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left behind those shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.43,0:00:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the endless everlasting\Nworld out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.57,0:00:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, somewhere, I'll finally see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.49,0:00:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light I have searched for everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the summer sun is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shaking the sails of my heart. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.67,0:01:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brand new world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.53,0:01:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that has been hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has opened up its doors for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.47,0:01:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A great, long blue sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.95,0:01:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wearing in the troubled ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.45,0:01:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From all despair I can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.93,0:01:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the horizon on the other side is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I travel far\Nfrom where my search began.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.65,0:01:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over streets of green and shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.27,0:01:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the endless\Neverlasting world out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.81,0:01:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday somewhere I'll finally see the\Nlight I will search for everywhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.73,0:01:53.82,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(692,0)\bord1.8\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(650,692,\1a&H00&)}Overture
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.73,0:01:53.82,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(692,0)\c&HF9F9F9&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Overture
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.73,0:01:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotta save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.09,0:01:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just got to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.41,0:02:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judgment has been made.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.35,0:02:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't even defeat a priest like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.17,0:02:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.89,0:02:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ignorant little creature, you're\Ndiving into your own watery grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.81,0:02:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now for the Sky Knight's noble steed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You no longer have a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Follow your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.41,0:02:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do wish that I could be there to\Nwatch the life drain from your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But alas, I have other matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.97,0:02:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to attend to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.09,0:02:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.55,0:02:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wonder if the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.97,0:03:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three fugitives have been\Ncaptured yet could a well really
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be that interesting yes don't\Nyou think it's odd that a well
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would be stuck under a tree the\Nbalance between civilization
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.31,0:03:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, unless we find a way to cross this\NCloud River, we'll be stuck in this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.21,0:03:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're still nowhere\Nnear where we want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.57,0:03:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like the people who built this didn't\Nknow the tree would grow to be so large.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.51,0:03:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.03,0:03:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.39,0:03:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you see anything up there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The island where God lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.93,0:03:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.57,0:03:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think she sees up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This island can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can win!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.43,0:04:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm a priest,\Nand you all look so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just end this now and die?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.57,0:04:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart can't take any more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too many surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.35,0:04:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.85,0:04:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be out of options quite soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sad, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.35,0:04:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your little boat has nearly\Nreached the forest's exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and when that happens,\Nit's all over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have nowhere to go unless of\Ncourse you suddenly learn to fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.69,0:04:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll wander around in this terribly\Nunfamiliar forest and die of exhaustion!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.27,0:04:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.43,0:04:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My turn now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.41,0:04:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, Ball Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you can't run forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And wherever you stop, the firebomb\Nball will be waiting to incinerate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.23,0:05:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.15,0:05:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we can still make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.53,0:05:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just leave things\Nhere with you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.99,0:05:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That tree will not give you any shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.39,0:05:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he's reading my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of my head and quit following me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.67,0:05:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A wire! What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.97,0:05:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, this must be how\Nhe controls the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just... No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.25,0:05:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ruined my sphere dragon,\Nyou impudent little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.55,0:05:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over here in this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.29,0:06:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of the dragon, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.47,0:06:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.67,0:06:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I could find the\Nway out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.51,0:06:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, this makes perfect sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.61,0:06:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I think of this sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.51,0:06:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we fell before, it was\Nfrom a very high altitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.39,0:06:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's only natural that the\Nexit be at the same height.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.59,0:06:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that I know where the exit is,\NThe boat doesn't really matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.35,0:06:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, that huge explosion worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd better hurry. Gain time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.91,0:07:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close that maniac must have\Nhad a death wish this isn't good
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.05,0:07:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to intensify my training.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.89,0:07:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let a weakling like him\Nget the upper hand in a fight
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That might block me from\Nusing my mantra. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.49,0:07:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.85,0:07:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.91,0:07:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not let him go, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was out cold on the forest floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where else would I have been, you idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's beside the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.09,0:07:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See the point is that you keep\Nsaying challenge this and challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.23,0:07:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that which normally wouldn't\Ninterest me however there are two
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,helpless ladies waiting for me to\Ncome to their rescue and i refuse
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.33,0:08:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to let them down so i'm proposing\Nthis and i think you'll like it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ordeal of love this guy's an idiot too
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.39,0:08:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unhead me this instant you maggot
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.23,0:08:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no honor, Jaggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.51,0:08:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have two against one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You creeps kidnapped our friends and\Ntried to murder a beautiful young angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you accuse us of not having any honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.71,0:08:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty amazing that you\Ncan predict our movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.15,0:08:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what good is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.19,0:08:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't do anything to avoid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.43,0:08:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.35,0:08:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.26,0:08:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.39,0:08:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you disobey me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.19,0:08:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a priest in God's service,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not being judged by me as a\Nfirst-degree crime in Skypiea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.27,0:08:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.59,0:09:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attacking me means you declare\Nwar of the almighty God, Ederu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.47,0:09:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you ever cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.51,0:09:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you don't have to be a chef to\Nknow which dish is best served cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, this dish is\Nreally quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.11,0:09:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step one, season the main course\Nwith a smattering of defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.57,0:09:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you must brutally and without\Nhesitation tenderize the meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.65,0:09:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't do this, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.91,0:09:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, please, no, don't hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.61,0:09:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.01,0:09:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Garp, the former god, made his\Nway into the Upper Yard alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.05,0:10:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Isa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.65,0:10:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.56,0:10:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Mantra?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.77,0:10:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.87,0:10:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.95,0:10:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying that you heard two voices,\Nand then they disappeared suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.69,0:10:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to be honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.73,0:10:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this true?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.65,0:10:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume that's yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should believe her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.73,0:10:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since she was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's been able to use her\Nability of mantra to sense people,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.23,0:10:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even those who are far away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking her gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.69,0:10:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you don't hear them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not there anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.45,0:10:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think it stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.77,0:10:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seemed like Gonfall was\Nfighting a priest and they...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killed each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nicely done, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.69,0:10:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are only three left now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.35,0:10:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.87,0:11:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess Heaven's actually\Nanswered our prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.25,0:11:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to crush\Nthose priests once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're launching a full-scale\Nattack on the upper yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper still makes you nervous, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to grow up sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky, wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.07,0:11:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.11,0:11:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't Gan Fall who\Ndefeated that priest!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are others on that side of the\Nisland and they're the ones that did
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It other people? You mean the ones\Nwho entered Skypiea from the Blue Sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.79,0:11:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who but\Nthey're really scary to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.87,0:11:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.15,0:11:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.09,0:11:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now be a good girl and hand over your bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't this is my special secret bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.43,0:11:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has treasure in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:11:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.31,0:12:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it will have even more inside\Nwhen I bring it back. Yeah? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.23,0:12:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.81,0:12:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.91,0:12:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.83,0:12:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doc!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, that's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's alive! That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.19,0:12:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I jumped in after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.57,0:12:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured we'd sink to our deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.99,0:12:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder who could have\Npulled us out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.33,0:12:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.24,0:12:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.13,0:13:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Jio!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.05,0:13:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.73,0:13:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.23,0:13:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough with the mystery, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.64,0:13:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us what you saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.17,0:13:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit ordering me around\Nand just do what I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.69,0:13:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get to the seashore!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.25,0:13:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would one of you please help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.93,0:13:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you help\Nyourself the seashore? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.35,0:13:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way we can get close\Nenough to check this thing out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because to be honest, I won't believe\Nwhat I saw until I see it up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.33,0:13:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't have shut up any sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.07,0:13:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.43,0:13:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy Sanji, I found the\Nboat, but you gotta move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.01,0:13:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm serious if we don't\Nget to it right now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.09,0:13:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be stuck on\Nthis stinking island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess Usopp's okay He's\Nyelling something about the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:13:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kick it into gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.05,0:14:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boat's leaving this place\Nand we gotta get on it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.27,0:14:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.35,0:14:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just hold on to my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your what? Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.21,0:14:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.81,0:14:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call marksmanship!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.73,0:14:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, you're my hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you try to kill all\Nyour heroes like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.49,0:14:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you pulled this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.49,0:14:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no more underestimating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.11,0:14:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.29,0:14:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will never let you forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.31,0:14:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I could have stretched\Nmy arm and grabbed the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.13,0:14:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, we're out of the\Nboat and out of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.39,0:15:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.05,0:15:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satori has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.43,0:15:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Losing control over his mantra only\Nshows his inexperience with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.03,0:15:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems the intruders this time are from\Nthe Blue Sea, but they behave strangely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.35,0:15:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sacrifices are now\Nmoving around freely as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.97,0:15:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, even if we leave them alone,\Nthey won't find their way off this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.37,0:15:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 2,0:15:32.06,0:15:36.56,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\pos(720,635)\bord0\blur1\c&HD8D6DB&\b0\fsp2\fscx108\fscy108}"Sky Punk" Gedatsu\NSkypiean Priest
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.06,0:15:36.56,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\pos(720,635)\1a&HFF&\blur1\bord2\3c&H1F1F1F&\b0\fsp2\fscx108\fscy108}"Sky Punk" Gedatsu\NSkypiean Priest
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.69,0:15:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear the voice of\Na sorrowful warrior, Holy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.37,0:15:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how many times we walk\Nthis road, things always end the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoulda defeated Gonfall, but\Nthe ordeal of Spheres was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where luck will end\Nfor our new challengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For them to attempt to see God\Nis insolence at its greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And their punishment at\Nmy hands will have things
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.51,0:16:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a bit unsettled this\Nevening in the Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:05.34,0:16:09.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\pos(720,635)\fscx108\fscy108\bord0\blur1\c&HF9F7F8&\fsp2}"Sky Breeder" Ohm\NSkypiean Priest{~Poppy}{his fingers are SO BIG}
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.34,0:16:09.84,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\pos(720,635)\fscx108\fscy108\1a&HFF&\blur1\bord3\3c&H101010&\fsp2}"Sky Breeder" Ohm\NSkypiean Priest{~Poppy}{his fingers are SO BIG}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one here gets out alive.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:09.84,0:16:19.31,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\pos(720,635)\fscx108\fscy108\bord0\blur1\c&HF8F7F8&\fsp2}"Sky Rider" Shura\NSkypiean Priest
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.84,0:16:19.31,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\pos(720,635)\fscx108\fscy108\1a&HFF&\blur1\bord3\3c&H101010&\fsp2}"Sky Rider" Shura\NSkypiean Priest
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.23,0:16:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ones who escaped\Nsacrifice are off my list.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems there are others roaming\Naround who are more worthy of my anger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today we catch up her yard\Nat her most vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.53,0:16:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the opportunity of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.47,0:16:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We move full speed ahead and don't\Nstop until we reach God's shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:16:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do not fear Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:17:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The great warrior Kalgar\Nis our one and only savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.07,0:17:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only to him are we true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Abraham?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.21,0:17:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready. Kamakiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.81,0:17:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.51,0:17:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We split up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We vow to the great warrior Kaldura\Nto light the fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.39,0:17:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the Shandians have come for a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaks for itself pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.11,0:17:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's no fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.15,0:17:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.91,0:17:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would this be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.07,0:17:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.51,0:17:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.75,0:17:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.21,0:17:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you figure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.63,0:18:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the other half of\Nwhat we saw before. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.89,0:18:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's bugged me for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.39,0:18:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it that we walk on soil\Nhere instead of Island Cloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dirt,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.47,0:18:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's nothing in the makeup of the White
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,White Sea that would\Nallow for its existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.83,0:18:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, the ground that we're walking\Non shouldn't exist up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upper Yard was originally on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.61,0:18:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that house was off\Nwhen I saw it. Thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.69,0:18:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's a Twister house, and there was no\Nstaircase leading up to the second story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.05,0:18:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what would make you build\Na house on the edge of a cliff?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.85,0:18:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then again, it wasn't a cliff at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look closer, it's really unattractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.53,0:18:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the guys gotta have some serious\Nguts to build a house that ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.01,0:19:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the half of the\Nisland that was ripped away?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This island used to be part of Jaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what that means is a\Nfew hundred years back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The island below us split in half,\Nand one side of it rose into the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either of you know how\Nthat could have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.27,0:19:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There were south birds,\Na whole flock of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.37,0:19:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.63,0:19:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know they got so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saru, would you wake up already? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:19:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.75,0:20:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no time for goofing off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.51,0:20:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city of gold that\NNolan discovered on the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ground didn't sink into\Nthe ocean like he guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This part of Jaya, it's been\Nfloating in the sky for 400 years!

